{"id":"5bbdbb772ea67a47","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-conformal-map.md","title":"Conformal Map","display":"df-conformal-map — Conformal Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-conformal-map","aliases":["58-df-conformal-map"],"display":"df-conformal-map — Conformal Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-analytic-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-conformal-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-conformal-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conformal-map — Conformal Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"af6c2296c347a5b6\" href=\"?note=af6c2296c347a5b6\" title=\"58-df-analytic-function.md\">58-df-analytic-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;\\subseteq\\mathbb C\">\\(\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb D=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|&lt;1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb D=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|&lt;1\\}\\)</span> (unit disk)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in(\\Omega&#39;)^\\Omega\">\\(f\\in(\\Omega&#39;)^\\Omega\\)</span> (map candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Analytic}_\\Omega(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Analytic}_\\Omega(f)\\)</span> (analytic-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"af6c2296c347a5b6\" href=\"?note=af6c2296c347a5b6\" title=\"58-df-analytic-function\">58-df-analytic-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\\)</span> (bijective-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConformalMap}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConformalMap}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\\)</span> (local conformal-map predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConformalEquivalence}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConformalEquivalence}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\\)</span> (bijective conformal-map predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormalizedRiemannMap}(f,\\Omega,z_0)\">\\(\\operatorname{NormalizedRiemannMap}(f,\\Omega,z_0)\\)</span> (归一化 Riemann 映射谓词, 本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{ConformalMap}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;) \\leftrightarrow \\Omega\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\Omega&#39;\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(\\{w\\in\\mathbb C:|w-z|&lt;r\\}\\subseteq\\Omega)\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega&#39;\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(\\{w\\in\\mathbb C:|w-z|&lt;r\\}\\subseteq\\Omega&#39;)\\land f\\in(\\Omega&#39;)^\\Omega\\land\\mathrm{Analytic}_\\Omega(f)\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land z+h\\in\\Omega\\to\\left|\\frac{f(z+h)-f(z)}h-a\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{ConformalMap}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;) \\leftrightarrow \\Omega\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\Omega&#39;\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(\\{w\\in\\mathbb C:|w-z|&lt;r\\}\\subseteq\\Omega)\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega&#39;\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(\\{w\\in\\mathbb C:|w-z|&lt;r\\}\\subseteq\\Omega&#39;)\\land f\\in(\\Omega&#39;)^\\Omega\\land\\mathrm{Analytic}_\\Omega(f)\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land z+h\\in\\Omega\\to\\left|\\frac{f(z+h)-f(z)}h-a\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal\\text{-}map\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{ConformalEquivalence}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ConformalMap}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal\\text{-}map\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{ConformalEquivalence}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ConformalMap}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal\\text{-}map\\text{-}normalized} \\vdash \\operatorname{NormalizedRiemannMap}(f,\\Omega,z_0) \\leftrightarrow z_0\\in\\Omega\\land\\operatorname{ConformalEquivalence}(f,\\Omega,\\mathbb D)\\land f(z_0)=0\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land z_0+h\\in\\Omega\\to\\left|\\frac{f(z_0+h)-f(z_0)}h-a\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal\\text{-}map\\text{-}normalized} \\vdash \\operatorname{NormalizedRiemannMap}(f,\\Omega,z_0) \\leftrightarrow z_0\\in\\Omega\\land\\operatorname{ConformalEquivalence}(f,\\Omega,\\mathbb D)\\land f(z_0)=0\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land z_0+h\\in\\Omega\\to\\left|\\frac{f(z_0+h)-f(z_0)}h-a\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The existence and uniqueness of a normalized Riemann map is a theorem, not a defining clause.</li>\n<li>Complex differentiability and the nonzero/positive derivative conditions are expanded by their difference-quotient limits; no real-derivative predicate is reused.</li>\n<li>Schwarz lemma requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb D\\to\\mathbb D\">\\(f:\\mathbb D\\to\\mathbb D\\)</span> holomorphic with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(0)=0\">\\(f(0)=0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Koebe quarter theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\mathbb{D})\">\\(f(\\mathbb{D})\\)</span> contains a ball of radius <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/4\">\\(1/4\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Automorphisms: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}(\\mathbb{D}) = \\{\\phi_\\alpha\\mid \\phi_\\alpha(z) = e^{i\\theta}\\frac{\\alpha-z}{1-\\bar{\\alpha}z}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}(\\mathbb{D}) = \\{\\phi_\\alpha\\mid \\phi_\\alpha(z) = e^{i\\theta}\\frac{\\alpha-z}{1-\\bar{\\alpha}z}\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Conformal modulus: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mod}(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{mod}(\\Omega)\\)</span> measures shape.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-analytic-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"af6c2296c347a5b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-analytic-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-analytic-function","status":"resolved","id":"af6c2296c347a5b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}_\\Omega(f)$ (analytic-function predicate, see [[58-df-analytic-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega')$ (bijective-map predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\Omega'\\subseteq\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb D=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|<1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in(\\Omega')^\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Analytic}_\\Omega(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega')","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConformalMap}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega')","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConformalEquivalence}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega')","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NormalizedRiemannMap}(f,\\Omega,z_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{ConformalMap}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega') \\leftrightarrow \\Omega\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\Omega'\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\Omega,\\Omega'\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;(\\{w\\in\\mathbb C:|w-z|<r\\}\\subseteq\\Omega)\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega'\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;(\\{w\\in\\mathbb C:|w-z|<r\\}\\subseteq\\Omega')\\land f\\in(\\Omega')^\\Omega\\land\\mathrm{Analytic}_\\Omega(f)\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(0<|h|<\\delta\\land z+h\\in\\Omega\\to\\left|\\frac{f(z+h)-f(z)}h-a\\right|<\\varepsilon\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal\\text{-}map\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{ConformalEquivalence}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega') \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ConformalMap}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega')\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\Omega,\\Omega')","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal\\text{-}map\\text{-}normalized} \\vdash \\operatorname{NormalizedRiemannMap}(f,\\Omega,z_0) \\leftrightarrow z_0\\in\\Omega\\land\\operatorname{ConformalEquivalence}(f,\\Omega,\\mathbb D)\\land f(z_0)=0\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(0<|h|<\\delta\\land z_0+h\\in\\Omega\\to\\left|\\frac{f(z_0+h)-f(z_0)}h-a\\right|<\\varepsilon\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb D\\to\\mathbb D","display":false},{"tex":"f(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\mathbb{D})","display":false},{"tex":"1/4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aut}(\\mathbb{D}) = \\{\\phi_\\alpha\\mid \\phi_\\alpha(z) = e^{i\\theta}\\frac{\\alpha-z}{1-\\bar{\\alpha}z}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{mod}(\\Omega)","display":false}],"bytes":2961,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-318","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-conformal-map]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","